@PaymentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Health
GET {{PaymentApi_HostAddress}}/health

### Create payment (success demo card)
POST {{PaymentApi_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "ORD-1001",
  "amount": 150.50,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "description": "Demo order",
  "use3DSecure": true,
  "callbackUrl": "https://example.com/payment/callback",
  "card": {
    "cardHolderName": "John Doe",
    "cardNumber": "5528790000000008",
    "expireMonth": "12",
    "expireYear": "2030",
    "cvv": "123"
  },
  "buyer": {
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "phone": "+905551112233",
    "identityNumber": "11111111111",
    "ipAddress": "127.0.0.1"
  },
  "billingAddress": {
    "contactName": "John Doe",
    "city": "Istanbul",
    "country": "Turkey",
    "address": "Example Mah. Demo Sok. No:1",
    "zipCode": "34000"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "ITEM-1",
      "name": "Demo Product",
      "category": "Electronics",
      "price": 150.50,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Create payment (decline demo card)
POST {{PaymentApi_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "ORD-1002",
  "amount": 50,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "card": {
    "cardHolderName": "Jane Doe",
    "cardNumber": "5406670000000009",
    "expireMonth": "12",
    "expireYear": "2030",
    "cvv": "123"
  },
  "buyer": {
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "phone": "+905551112244"
  },
  "billingAddress": {
    "contactName": "Jane Doe",
    "city": "Ankara",
    "country": "Turkey",
    "address": "Demo Cad. No:2"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "ITEM-1",
      "name": "Demo Product",
      "category": "General",
      "price": 50,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Get payment
GET {{PaymentApi_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{paymentId}

### List payments
GET {{PaymentApi_HostAddress}}/api/payments
